+# TLS certificate verification
+
+TLS certificate verification is enabled in all builds, including development builds, as well as staging and production. Development and test environments use self-signed certificates so that verification stays on, and it is not bypassed to make local work easier. This keeps development practices from carrying over into production by accident.
